      729.92
    ],
    "text": "Name of the land: Koongahamulahena alias Kahatagahamulahena; Description: Home garden, 112 Coconut trees of about 30 - 40 Years old, 108 Coconut trees of about 01 - 05 years old, nine Jack trees, 32 teak trees, 1 Sooriyamara tree, 1 Halmilla tree, 2 permanent buildings, a foundation and a cement constructed well, available; Claimant: Mirissage Sujith Stanly Fernando,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
