  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      476.0,
      539.39,
      601.04
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at the Pannala Divisional Secretariat on 22nd March, 2017 at 10.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 15th March, 2017 the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said lands, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
